{
  "sourceId": "post-The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone-zh-CN",
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "source": {
    "kind": "single-post",
    "postId": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵在 iOS 中模拟网络延迟甚至不良网络条件非常简单。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您不需要设置代理、路由器或不良的网络提供商。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您所要做的就是使用 Xcode 启用开发者模式。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然后，您可以看到**开发者**图标，它允许您轻松模拟各种网络场景。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在开发者下，您可以看到 **Network Link Conditioner**。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "默认情况下它是*关闭*的。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "点击 **Network Link Conditioner**，↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "有几个配置文件供您使用。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您可以利用从您的手机到目标后端的 **ping** 时间（往返），然后减去从实验室后端的 **ping** 时间。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "要创建新的配置文件，只需点击 **Add a profile...**↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "假设 ping 时间为 900ms，您可以设置 **Out Delay**、**In Delay** 或两者。↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上对应用程序执行网络延迟测试的最简单方法",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "完成！",
